Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): reference for the turning operations

One section per turning kind in the registry (Facing, Profile Rough,
Profile Finish, Groove Rough, Groove Finish, Part, Threading, Chamfer,
Taper, Multi-Pass, Form, Bore): what it is for, its tabs and seed
defaults, the tool it takes and its common refusals, plus the lathe
concepts every kind shares (no picks, spindle axis, G96/G97 surface
speed and feed per rev, the workholding rpm ceiling, holder checks).
Linked from the operations page.

Refs #1250

